                        "target_lang_word": "greasy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "greasy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e143670-35af-370e-bddc-b8d1ccf33114",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a slippery surface; having a surface covered with grease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78ef2230-229e-40ee-bb4f-755fcef9664f",
                                                "sense_id": "4e143670-35af-370e-bddc-b8d1ccf33114",
                                                "text": "a greasy mineral"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf44b38e-00ba-4f5e-a3ce-dd0c44e370b6",
                                                "sense_id": "4e143670-35af-370e-bddc-b8d1ccf33114",
                                                "text": "[…] mechanic slaves\nWith greasy aprons, rules, and hammers, shall\nUplift us to the view […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a570064f-376a-4040-a42e-b10544fba18c",
                                                "sense_id": "4e143670-35af-370e-bddc-b8d1ccf33114",
                                                "text": "it was in the garage that Alec worked, […] doing mysterious greasy things. Grease blackened his hairy legs; grease had turned his white canvas shoes black; grease blackened his hands even beyond the wrist; grease made his short working trousers black and stiff. Yet he had the gift, which Mr Biswas admired, of being able to hold a cigarette between greasy fingers and greasy lips without staining it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7a35c7d-f07a-3305-ac70-e335c7052174",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Containing a lot of grease or fat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95f9b478-fc43-4c87-bcd7-e69bc41f149b",
                                                "sense_id": "f7a35c7d-f07a-3305-ac70-e335c7052174",
                                                "text": "c. 1795, Margaret Taylor, Mrs. Taylor’s Family Companion: or The Whole Art of Cookery Display’d, London: W. Lane, “To fry flat Fish,” p. 37,\nBefore you dish them up, lay them upon a drainer before the fire sloping, for two or three minutes, which will prevent their eating greasy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a63e3bdf-f3ca-4e21-b740-44277873621b",
                                                "sense_id": "f7a35c7d-f07a-3305-ac70-e335c7052174",
                                                "text": "With a skin full of alcohol and a probable overwhelming desire for a greasy kebab, I had evidently got myself into such a state that I was unable to locate the correct door to the fast food shop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9b25f84-2ad4-49f7-8bf3-8612a8504d9d",
                                                "sense_id": "f7a35c7d-f07a-3305-ac70-e335c7052174",
                                                "text": "Nigel and Richard Bertinet go for butter. Jamie and Nigella both opt for olive oil, and Garten uses a mixture, spreading the bread generously with butter, then topping it with garlic and herbs in olive oil. Oil, to my taste, simply makes the bread seem greasy: it's great for dipping, but it doesn't seem to soak into the bread in the same way as butter – I've probably just got hopelessly rich Anglo-Saxon tastes, but for me, it's butter all the way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5212e0dc-20b8-339e-a0da-8b87b4df1724",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Shady, sketchy, dodgy, detestable, unethical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb69c675-8b31-4287-8c93-807a509438d2",
                                                "sense_id": "5212e0dc-20b8-339e-a0da-8b87b4df1724",
                                                "text": "Julian: We're gonna fill the trailers up with furniture all right, boys, but we're gonna rent them out by the hour.\n Bubbles: Aw, that's greasy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aa826f4-026e-3246-9a4d-54d9b06f1973",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fat, bulky."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca3d09cb-1cca-4cd4-9fa5-341937f81ef9",
                                                "sense_id": "0aa826f4-026e-3246-9a4d-54d9b06f1973",
                                                "text": "Let’s consult together against this greasy knight."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a66e3db4-31d6-3004-9dcf-4de35c4817b7",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gross; indelicate; indecent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97a54605-7dde-4a73-afd3-c50eaa1f3dbf",
                                                "sense_id": "a66e3db4-31d6-3004-9dcf-4de35c4817b7",
                                                "text": "Now I am perfect hate, I lou’d but three things in the world, Philosophy, Thrift, and my self. Thou hast made me hate Philosophy. A Vsurers greasie Codpeece made me loath Thrift: but if all the Brewers Iades in the town can drug me from loue of my selfe, they shall doo more then e’re the seuen wise men of Greece could […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb89d7b3-e6c5-37c1-85ce-d6bb788fc8c9",
                                        "entry_id": "8733cd8f-d07a-3fe0-baab-aa1d89ee9656",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Afflicted with the disease called grease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a horse"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "greasy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7270eab-444a-37ec-afda-a24657d86c6e",
                                        "entry_id": "75550f2c-8840-32fd-a77b-5add92192a6d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An annoyed or contemptuous look; a dirty look."
